  "prefLabel": "Mtec 205.21 Burden of Proof",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mtec 205.21 Burden of Proof.\n\nThe party asserting the affirmative of a proposition shall have the burden of proving the truth of that proposition by a preponderance of the evidence.\n\nSource. #11091-A, eff 5-5-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mtec200.html"
